    "title": "Why Gnats Are Suddenly Taking Over New York Evenings - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kelvine ,\n5 hours ago Evenings in New York have begun to feel different. As the light softens and the air cools, small clouds of insects seem to gather in places where people pause, walk, or sit. They hover near faces, drift over sidewalks, and cluster under streetlights. For many residents, the experience feels sudden, as if these insects appeared overnight and took control of the evening hours. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
